\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;((a\\to b\\land a\\to c)\\Longrightarrow\\exists d\\in A\\;(b\\to d\\land c\\to d)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Diamond}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;((a\\to b\\land a\\to c)\\Longrightarrow\\exists d\\in A\\;(b\\to d\\land c\\to d)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两条底边均恰好一步，故此定义比局部合流强；允许b=c，不把相同分支排除。原书指出反身关系尤其适合使用此性质。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 为集合，$\\to\\subseteq A\\times A$；单关系抽象归约系统见 [[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\to\\subseteq A\\times A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diamond}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\;((a\\to b\\land a\\to c)\\Longrightarrow\\exists d\\in A\\;(b\\to d\\land c\\to d)).","display":true}],"bytes":1109,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-diamond-property.md]]"},{"id":"6bf45d8047f2ba42","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"菱形性质与合流见 [[56-df-diamond-property]]、[[56-df-confluent]]。"},{"id":"28e999711473c30c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · de